    "root_cause": "Shared Postgres database latency",
    "mechanism": "Forecast-pipeline queries to Postgres are slow due to lock contention, a heavy query, or connection-pool exhaustion, inflating pipeline duration.",
    "statement": "The fault originates in service:gridcast:postgres, a direct critical dependency of forecast-pipeline, so database latency would directly raise forecast-pipeline p95."
  },
  {
    "root_cause": "Feature-service degradation",
    "mechanism": "Feature-service is saturated or degraded, causing forecast-pipeline to block on feature computation/retrieval calls.",
    "statement": "The fault originates in service:gridcast:feature-service, which is a direct dependency of forecast-pipeline and appears to primarily serve it, so its latency would manifest mainly in forecast-pipeline."
  },
  {
    "root_cause": "Forecast-service degradation",
    "mechanism": "Forecast-service model inference is slow due to resource saturation or request queueing, causing forecast-pipeline to wait on inference responses.",
    "statement": "The fault originates in service:gridcast:forecast-service, a direct single-consumer dependency of forecast-pipeline, so its slowdown would directly inflate forecast-pipeline duration."
  },
  {
    "root_cause": "Planning-api degradation",
    "mechanism": "Planning-api is saturated or degraded, causing forecast-pipeline to block on planning-data or context calls.",
